# Customize Your Twin Module-500 Frame Setup

Well done! You've selected a 2-module configuration for this frame, dividing the frame into 2 equal sections 500mm x 500mm x 500mm, for added variety (e.g., herbs in one module and small fish in the other). 

Next we will walk you through setting up each module in turn.

